# Analytics (optional). Without VITE_UMAMI_ID nothing is loaded and nothing is sent.
# Set these in Netlify → Project configuration → Environment variables, not here,
# so local development stays out of the numbers. Copy to .env.local to test locally.

VITE_UMAMI_ID=
# Only when self-hosting Umami; defaults to https://cloud.umami.is/script.js
# VITE_UMAMI_SRC=
